{
  "name": "Rendley — Brand Kit From Website",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Brand Kit From Website\n\nPOST a website URL and a workspace ID. Rendley extracts the site's **colors, fonts and logos** into that workspace's brand kit, then this flow reads the kit back and returns a confirmation in the same request.\n\n**Send:** `POST /webhook/brandkit-import` with `{ \"website_url\": \"https://example.com\", \"workspace_id\": \"YOUR_WORKSPACE_ID\" }`.\n\nUse the imported brand kit to keep captions, colors and logos on-brand in your other Rendley video workflows.",
        "height": 280,
        "width": 400,
        "color": 4
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000001",
      "name": "About",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-220, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### Plan + cost\nBrand-kit import needs a valid **Rendley account / API key**. It parses a public website and is a lightweight, synchronous call — no export, and it does not burn the heavier AI **credits** that video/audio generation does. (Some plans still meter it — check your account.)",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 340,
        "color": 3
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000002",
      "name": "Plan and cost",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [240, 120]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "### No file produced\nThis workflow writes brand data into your workspace and returns JSON — it does not create a media file, so there is nothing that expires to copy out. (Rendley export URLs expire after ~4h and presigned media URLs after ~3h in the templates that *do* produce files.)",
        "height": 190,
        "width": 360,
        "color": 6
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000003",
      "name": "No file note",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [-220, 640]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "path": "brandkit-import",
        "responseMode": "responseNode",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000010",
      "name": "Incoming Request",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [-180, 420],
      "webhookId": "brandkit-import-in"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "brandKit",
        "operation": "importFromWebsite",
        "brandKitWorkspaceId": "={{ $json.body.workspace_id }}",
        "websiteUrl": "={{ $json.body.website_url }}"
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000011",
      "name": "Import Brand Kit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [80, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "resource": "brandKit",
        "operation": "get",
        "brandKitWorkspaceId": "={{ $('Incoming Request').item.json.body.workspace_id }}"
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000012",
      "name": "Read Brand Kit",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-rendley.rendley",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [340, 420],
      "credentials": {
        "rendleyApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "Rendley API"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "respondWith": "json",
        "responseBody": "={{ JSON.stringify({ status: 'imported', workspace_id: $('Incoming Request').item.json.body.workspace_id, source: $('Incoming Request').item.json.body.website_url, brand_kit: $json }) }}",
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "18000000-0000-4000-8000-000000000013",
      "name": "Confirm",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.respondToWebhook",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [600, 420]
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Incoming Request": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Import Brand Kit", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Import Brand Kit": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Read Brand Kit", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Read Brand Kit": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Confirm", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {},
  "pinData": {},
  "meta": {
    "templateCredsSetupCompleted": false
  }
}
